  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/cmr_banner\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://discord.gg/nFBAXfb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=5865f2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://github.com/iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=000000&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=FF0000&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/iglee42/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=f16436&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252figlee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=1ace65&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></div>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:30px\"><span style=\"color:#808080;font-size:30px\">更多合成創造</span> 是 <span style=\"color:#f90\"><a style=\"font-weight:normal !important;color:#f90;font-size:30px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">創造模組</a> </span> 的擴充模組<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">這個擴充模組新增了與創造模組相關的合成配方<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">目前已支援的創造模組版本 6.0.10</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#fc0\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">部分靈感來自 <a style=\"font-size:24px\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrMLDEG\" rel=\"nofollow\">MLDEG</a></span><br></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:30px\">配方類型<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">風扇搭配自訂方塊：<br></span></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:left\"><code>{\n  \"type\": \"cmr:custom_fan\",\n  \"ingredients\": [\n    {\n      \"tag\": \"c:cobblestone\" //要投擲的物品\n    },\n    {\n      \"item\": \"minecraft:oak_fence\" //風扇後方的方塊（若存在流體則可選）\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"fluid_stack\",\n      \"amount\": 1000,\n      \"fluid\": \"create:honey\" // 流體（若存在方塊則可選）\n    }\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"item\": {\n        \"id\": \"minecraft:diamond\" //結果物品\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}</code></pre>\n<br>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">方塊澆注：<br></span></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:left\"><code>{\n  \"type\": \"cmr:block_spouting\",\n  \"ingredients\": [\n    {\n      \"item\": \"minecraft:dirt\" //澆注口下方的方塊\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"fluid_stack\",\n      \"amount\": 500, //流體量\n      \"fluid\": \"minecraft:water\" //澆注口中的流體\n    }\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"item\": {\n        \"id\": \"minecraft:grass_block\" //輸出的方塊\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}</code></pre>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2723\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/541199/description_4e1cb9c4-bc3f-41dd-8136-0e734888fb1f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"133\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">你可以在你的模組包中使用本模組，但不得在其他網站上重新發布本模組！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Curseforge 是本模組唯一發布的網站</span></p>\n</div>",
